The '''Magma Village''' is an island in the [[First Sea]].

==Appearance==
The Magma Village if often distinguished by its' huge volcano in the center with smoke rings all around it (no collision hitbox). The front of the island is covered in rocky ground and red trees, with a small village near the dock. Behind the volcano is a raised stone platform that extends out from the back of the island, being able to be navigated to through a slope in front of it.

==Location==
The Magma Village can be found at the south of the [[Pirate Village]] in First Sea.

