==Secret Quests==
* In the middle of the lava lake, a lava geyser can be seen. Break it using any M1 and an elemental mini-boss will come out of it. Defeat it and it will split into three more enemies, kill those three as well.
* After waiting an unspecified amount of time at Magma Village (Probably every 1 hour and a half.), a message will appear in chat saying: '''[[System Messages|''"A loud drilling is shaking the Magma Village"'']]'''  At the back of the island near the water will be a mineshaft entrance. Enter the mineshaft by getting on the elevator, the player will find themselves in a mini-game. Avoid the light shined by the workers and get to the drill area, then destroy the drill at the end of the mineshaft and get on the 2nd elevator.
* When [[Magma General]] awakens (every hour, someone or you must stay in the island or else it will not activate), a message will appear in chat saying:  '''[[System Messages|''"A rumbling echoes out to the sea..."'']]'''  To start the boss fight, break five miniature lava geysers on the outside of the volcano using an M1 attack.  After they are defeated, a message will appear in chat saying:  '''[[System Messages|''"(Roblox username) defeated the awakened Magma General"'']]'''

==Notes==
* To save time, it would've been recommended to grind [[Swan]] from [[Levels]] 300 through 350 instead of the [[Military Soldier]] or [[Military Spy]], because they were less efficient to grind. Afterwards, the player could proceed with the [[Magma Admiral]]. This cannot be done anymore as Swan was replaced with Don Megalo's Guard.
* There's a chance that you can obtain [[Magma Ore]] by killing enemies on Magma Village.
* It is recommended to use [[Blade]], [[Buddha]], or long-ranged fruits like [[Light]] at the Magma Village, as majority of the enemies have [[Aura]].
* Some of the  [[Military Soldier]]s have a chance to spawn without aura.
* If the player uses the [[Magma]] fruit, they won't take any damage from the lava stream from the volcano. The player will be damaged upon touching the lava otherwise, unless they are using the transformed forms of [[Mammoth]], [[Leopard]] or [[Venom]].
** More about lava immunity can be found '''[[Lava|here]]'''.

