==Trivia==
* The [[Living Skeleton]] can be found at the Magma Village, selling the [[Soul Cane]] for {{Money|750,000}}. The player can find him in a secret passageway in the volcano near the left side of the island and close to the fruit spawn location.
* Magma Village is the first island to include a surface that damages players (that being the [[lava]] river that goes beneath the bridge and some magma inside the volcano).
* [[Blade]] and [[Buddha]] are recommended when grinding on Magma Village as the enemies [[aura]] shall cause their sword not to hit the player. In the case of Buddha, its long range prevents NPCs from hitting the player.
* Magma Village is the first island that was added to the game after the original release.
* The portion of Lava initially hidden by the bridge is also capable of damaging the player when exposed by breaking it.

